chan Arrives 193 CE 貂蝉在193年加入玩家派系","short":"182 - YES\r\n190 - YES\r\n194 - NO\r\nA World Betrayed version:\r\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2029124191\r\n===================================================\r\n\r\nSABLE CICADA\r\n\r\n\"My","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"drgoosqiaosistersarrive.pack","order":28,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2033128001/DrGoosQiaoSistersArrive.pack","name":"The Qiao Sisters Arrive - A World Betrayed","short":"182 - YES\r\n190 - YES\r\n194 - YES\r\n200 - YES - But duplication issues\r\n\r\nA lot of requests for the Qiao sisters, so here they are. Both come to the player faction when they come of age at 18. You do NOT","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"drgoossunrenarrives.pack","order":21,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1976264156/DrGoosSunRenArrives.pack","name":"Sun Ren Arrives 207 CE: 孙仁在207年秋加入玩家派系","short":"182 - YES\r\n190 - YES\r\n194 - YES\r\n200 - YES\r\n\r\nTHE RISING SUN\r\n\r\n\"My Lord, all chaos has broken out, a young warmaiden has arrived and is giving out orders left and right. Our men are running around li","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"drgoossunrenarrives1.pack","order":36,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1976496392/DrGoosSunRenArrives1.pack","name":"Sun Ren Arrives Autumn 207 CE (KOR) 손인 207년 합류","short":"모든 권리는 원 제작자(DR GOO)에게 있으며,\r\n저는 번역자입니다.\r\n\r\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1976264156\r\n\r\n제작자의 db 허용으로 더는 수정이 없을겁니다.\r\n이 모드 단일로 사용하시면 됩니다.\r\n\r\n인게임 사진 못찍어서 메모장으로 대체함\r\n\r\nㅡㅡㅡㅡㅡ\r\n\r\n-손인","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"drgooszhaoyunarrives.pack","order":28,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1824352284/DrGoosZhaoYunArrives.pack","name":"Zhao Yun arrives 195CE - 赵云。到了第四轮","short":"182 - YES\r\n190 - YES\r\n194 - YES\r\n\r\nRAGING TIGER\r\n\r\n\"My Lord, the legendary warlord Zhao Yun has arrived at our camp with a small band of volunteers. Zhao Yun had originally intended to aid Gongsun Zan","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"drgooszhengjiangarrives.pack","order":21,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1815801807/DrGoosZhengJiangArrives.pack","name":"Zheng Jiang Arrives 190 CE","short":"NOTE: Having more than 2 \"Arrives\" mods in 190 can push the game events out of date, I never intend people will use all of them but will choose a character of their choice. That's why I stagger the ar","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"expert_ai_by_kon_v1.pack","order":40,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2228901190/Expert_AI_by_Kon_v1.pack","name":"Expert AI","short":"[b](Updated for patch 1.7.1, enjoy!)[/b]\r\n\r\n[h1] Overview: [/h1]\r\nThis mod improves a plethora of different modifiers for the [u][b]AI only[/b][/u]. The purpose of this mod is to give the player a muc","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"fpsboost.pack","order":31,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2421493375/FPSBoost.pack","name":"FPS Boost 帧率增加 +10%","short":"For potato computers where GPU is the bottleneck! Will not help much with weak CPUs.\r\nBest used with Low and Medium settings.\r\n\r\n适用于弱GPU\r\n\r\n适用于中低端游戏环境 \r\n\r\n\r\n修改 : 没有视频效果 （VFX) ，LOD 修改, 质地 修改\r\n没有太大的区别 \r","category":"battle","owned":false},{"uuid":"generic3.pack","order":42,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1987995916/generic3.pack","name":"Huangfu Song Joins Player Faction","short":"Huangfu Song leaves the Han Empire to join the player on turn 10.\r\n\r\n皇甫嵩离开汉族帝国，在第10回合加入该玩家。\r\n\r\nHuangfu Song은 10 번째 턴에 한 제국을 떠나 플레이어와 합류합니다.","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"goguryeo.pack","order":41,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1821859352/Goguryeo.pack","name":"New Faction : Goguryeo (Unique Flag)","short":"New Faction : Goguryeo (Unique Flag) \r\n\r\ngame level : in game first - very hard / in game last - very easy\r\n\r\nFaction Skill\r\n\r\n1) Gaemamusa Horse riding \r\n\r\nFaction horse man - upkeep expenses -50%\r\nF","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"grant_independence_manually.pack","order":42,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1810002654/grant_independence_manually.pack","name":"Create Vassals: Grant Administrator Independence","short":"This is a simple mod that adds a new political action in the court menu which allows you to release an administrator of a commandery to become their own faction. \r\n\r\nThey take the commandery which the","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"hanmuyan-1-addunit.pack","order":31,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2573677779/HanMuYan-1-AddUnit.pack","name":"解锁兵种 - 自建武将寒慕言 Add On","short":"[h1]说明[/h1]\r\n寒慕言可招募 [b]精英兵种[/b]：北军、匈奴、羽林军\r\n需求： 习得兵仙技能\r\n\r\n[h1]备注[/h1]\r\n*并非整个派系， 只有寒慕言可以招募\r\n*模组在游戏前期过于强力， 慎用\r\n*此mod 可用 也可不用，看个人，纯属让寒慕言有多一点用兵种可以用","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"hanmuyan-1.pack","order":32,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/common/Total War THREE KINGDOMS/data/HanMuYan-1.pack","name":"自建女武将来投-寒慕言 （1.7以上版本）","short":"[h1]说明[/h1]\r\n传闻此将乃汉初[b]韩氏名将后代[/b]， 为避免汉高祖斩草除根， 后代更姓为寒。 寒慕言生逢乱世， 决定跟随先祖意志， 出山投奔明主。\r\n\r\n[b]传奇火属性女武将[/b]\r\n三个人物专属技能\r\n武将属性：带兵打仗强力、派系领袖强力、 太守较弱\r\n（目前武将的技能还在调整中，武将能力都放在人物专属技能了，会持续更新，取决于大家喜欢强力一点还是平衡一点）\r\n\r\n\r\n[h1","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"havie_capture_chance.pack","order":32,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2168623862/Havie_capture_chance.pack","name":"Capture Chance On Faction Destroy","short":"[h1]You can ignore the launcher warnings about being up to date , and test yourself if its working before commenting. [/h1]\r\n\r\n[h1] Capture Officers On Faction Destroy [/h1]\r\n\r\n[b] Compatible with eve","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"havie_capture_chance_chinese_traditional_addon.pack","order":48,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2169683100/Havie_capture_chance_Chinese_Traditional_addon.pack","name":"Capture Chance On Faction Destroy | 繁體中文語言套件","short":"This is the Chinese Traditional Add-On for [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2168623862]Capture Chance On Faction Destroy[/url].\r\n\r\n這是 [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedf","category":"ui","owned":false},{"uuid":"helmets4infantry.pack","order":48,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1791393683/Helmets4Infantry.pack","name":"Better Helmets for Infantry. Formerly BrainBuckets.","short":"This mod adds better helmets and shoulder armor to these units.\r\nJian Cavalry and captains\r\nSabre Cavalry\r\nLance Cavalry and captains\r\nSabre Infantry\r\nJi Infantry and captains\r\nArchers\r\nCrossbowmen an","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"hero_young_old.pack","order":34,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1995740149/Hero_young_old.pack","name":"[WDG : grow aged] Unique Only (1.7v)","short":"[h1] INFOMATION [/h1]\r\n이 모드는 영웅들이 시간이 흐름에 따라 모습을 변경되는 모드입니다.\r\n1.60 이후 문제를 일으켜서 모델링은 삭제되었습니다.\r\n\r\nThis is the mod in which heroes change appearance over time.\r\nModeling has been deleted since 1.60 due t","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"jiesuoshibing.pack","order":55,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2097434815/jiesuoshibing.pack","name":"All factions unlock all arms 所有派系解锁全部兵种","short":"新开档有效。\r\n\r\n喜欢的左上角点个赞，谢谢。\r\n\r\n搞的比较匆忙，部分派系可能会缺少几个兵种。","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"kurokuma'scaptivemod.pack","order":56,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1801321246/Kurokuma'sCaptiveMod.pack","name":"Big update!  [Yellow Turban Overhaul]  (old name: Catch 'Em All )","short":"\r\n\r\n[h1] Introduction: [/h1] \r\n[b]Remove the captive and hire limitation between factions of different subculture：[/b]\r\n   •Allow you to hire captive Yellow Turban generals when you are playing Han fa","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"kurokuma'senglishpack.pack","order":4,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1803231743/Kurokuma'sEnglishPack.pack","name":"KuroKuma's English Pack for All Factions Playable & New Major Factions","short":"This is my mod's English translation package.\r\nAll the things are translated by myself, so dont expect a very high quality translation.\r\n\r\nAnyone could feel free to upload any improved versions of thi","category":"ui","owned":false},{"uuid":"kurokuma'sfactionmod-core.pack","order":6,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1794247900/Kurokuma'sFactionMod-core.pack","name":"【黑熊的非官方DLC part1】 -- 全派系解锁  All Factions Playable","short":"English follows,\r\n\r\n[h1] 请阅读说明！[/h1] \r\n这是一个解锁开局时地图上所有派系的mod，包括全部182,190,194,200, 291 五个剧本。\r\n\r\n[img]https://i.imgur.com/fVVaDCS.gif[/img]\r\n\r\n[h1] 简介[/h1] \r\n这一mod分为三个部分，\r\n\r\n[u] [b]1.  解锁部分，既当前页面。 [/b][/","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"kurokuma'sfactionmod-rebalance.pack","order":7,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1794260672/Kurokuma'sFactionMod-rebalance.pack","name":"【黑熊的非官方DLC part 2】更多主要派系 V2.1  New Major Factions","short":"[img]https://steamuserimages-a.akamaihd.net/ugc/788630633713445427/D314E8AAE302DBDFAECD651FEB946E7F0C51A27C/[/img]\r\n\r\n[img]https://steamuserimages-a.akamaihd.net/ugc/788630633713445966/FD107EAC9886D55","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"kurokuma'svietnamesepack.pack","order":36,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1869836627/Kurokuma'sVietnamesePack.pack","name":"Vietnamese Translation Pack for \"All Factions Playable\" and \"New Major Factions (Han Empire Fix, 1.2.1 beta) [OUTDATED]","short":"[b][i] Please take a note before using [/i][/b]\r\n\r\n[b][i] This is an add-on mod change chinese/english into vietnamese translate by NQ so please if you using anthor Vietnamese pack by another it'll be","category":"ui","owned":false},{"uuid":"lady_cai_yan.pack","order":51,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2265470380/lady_cai_yan.pack","name":"More beautiful Lady Cai Yan","short":"[url=https://www.patreon.com/minatowantae] Support my patreon to support my work [/url]\r\n\r\nThis mod change [b] Lady Cai Yan [/b] portrait ( ͡° ͜ʖ ͡°)\r\nUsing picture provided by Beosyeu\r\n[b] Important:","category":"ui","owned":false},{"uuid":"ladymi.pack","order":52,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2221494257/ladymi.pack","name":"More beautiful Lady Mi","short":"[url=https://www.patreon.com/minatowantae] Support my patreon to support my work [/url]\r\n\r\nThis mod change Lady Mi portrait ( ͡° ͜ʖ ͡°)\r\nThis mod is using picture provided by 三国无双\r\n[img]https://i.imgu","category":"ui","owned":false},{"uuid":"marriage harem mod 1.51 english ver.pack","order":18,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2765173516/Marriage Harem Mod 1.51 English Ver.pack","name":"Marriage Harem Mod 1.51 English Ver.pack","short":"What Kind Of Mod Is This?\r\n\r\nWant Your Favorite Wife/Concubine To Stay With You In Court And Have Multiple Reserves?\r\nConcubine system can make your family tree populated with unlimited children that'","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"mod_add_admin_16_ver.pack","order":38,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1791434309/MOD_add_admin_16_ver.pack","name":"add admin 7 more sup 1.7","short":"add more 7 administrators @ game start for the player only.\r\nThis mod changed the maximum \"administrator\" to 16 positions.\r\nAfter position 12, you have to assist the admin by Click the city first and ","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"mod_puzzle3d.pack","order":17,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2236951583/mod_Puzzle3D.pack","name":"Puzzle3D (v1.7.1)","short":"[h1]KOREAN[/h1]\r\n퍼즐 전용 모델링 342개가 추가됩니다.\r\n전용모델링을 아직 못만든 일러스트의 경우 일러와 모델링이 일치 하지 않습니다.(약100개)\r\n\r\n[b]해당모드는 MTU와 Puzzle, WDG2를 필수로 필요로 합니다.[/b]\r\n*WDG2 mtu addon은 필요 없습니다.\r\n\r\n함께 제작에 힘써주신 '화성까마귀, 서량기병마등, k.","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"more_admins.pack","order":53,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1967399884/more_admins.pack","name":"More Admins","short":"Adds up to 3 extra Administrator slots (based on faction rank).\r\n\r\nThis mod aims to add extra Admin slots without going overboard like some other mods. The number of extra slots you get on top of the ","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"more_ancillaries.pack","order":36,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2027915622/more_ancillaries.pack","name":"More Ancillaries at start and from battles","short":"This modifies the original values for the ancillaries on the first turn, after battles (victory), and after sieges (victory). \r\n\r\nYou will earn between 8 - 12 ancillaries at the start of the campaign ","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"mtu_general_redmodelled.pack","order":46,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2025406762/MTU_general_redmodelled.pack","name":"Make Them Unique - MTU Characters Remodeled","short":"This is a remodel mod for the excellent [url=https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=1812159400][b]Make Them Unique Mod[/b][/url] by [b]Illustrator.noob[/b]. What this mod does is changing","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"norse_no_old_age.pack","order":65,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1769969693/norse_no_old_age.pack","name":"No death by old age","short":"UPDATE: I've made an exception for Tao Qian, since his death is part of Liu Beis campaign opening. He now dies between age 62 and 65 as normal.\r\n\r\nDoes exactly what it says on the tin.\r\n\r\nOverrides al","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"porninside.pack","order":37,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1979545869/PornInside.pack","name":"All DLC Characters Join 190 Campaign","short":"8 Princes, He Jin and Zhen Ji invades the 190 campaign. They will join the player's faction on turn 3.\r\nKeep them as your loyal companions or release them into the wild to make the main campaign more ","category":"units","owned":false},{"uuid":"puzzle complete.pack","order":16,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1836381931/PUZZLE COMPLETE.pack","name":"Puzzle illustration (1.7.1)","short":"[h1] Mod Introduction [/h1]\r\n\r\nCampaigns: 182/190/194/200\r\n\r\nThis mod applies illustrations to clone generals appearing as historical figures, giving each general a unique personality.\r\n\r\nIt provides ","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"reset_character.pack","order":47,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2001589363/Reset_Character.pack","name":"Reset skills","short":"Function:\r\nReset characters' skills when you start new campaign (new savefile required)\r\nReset characters' skills when you recruit them\r\n\r\nOnly available to player, but you can reset AI when they join","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"respec_characters.pack","order":39,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1803671821/respec_characters.pack","name":"Respec Character Skills when they join you","short":"This is a simple mod. \r\n\r\nI got annoyed by recruiting characters and seeing that the AI spent all their skill points on weird skills. \r\n\r\nWhen you recruit a hero to your faction, their skill points wi","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"taishi_comes.pack","order":58,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1966902925/taishi_comes.pack","name":"Taishi Ci Comes","short":"Taishi Ci will join the players faction at the next available turn. The following turn, the unique bow 'The Black Dragon' will also spawn for use.\r\n\r\nI wanted to spawn Taishi Ci's unique bow but for s","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"testerduo.pack","order":57,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1843059537/testerduo.pack","name":"THREE new Heroes, Lion, Valiant and Ying Yue","short":"I added three new heroes to the main campaign. \r\n\r\nIf you like it please hit that LIKE button :) No must, but apprechiate it. \r\n\r\nThe Lion\r\nA man stranded, with no memory of who he is, a fighter, a he","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"tifa.pack","order":67,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","pack