":"Wu Kingdaissance V5.9.0","short":"[h1][b]What does the mod do[/b][/h1]\r\nWu is a comprehensive mod that changes your game experience with regards to generals entirely. \r\n- unique historical general design: over 300 generals are given n","category":"overhaul","owned":false},{"uuid":"wu_kingdaissance_1.1.0_concubine.pack","order":76,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2237664422/Wu_Kingdaissance_1.1.0_concubine.pack","name":"Wu Kingdaissance V5.2.0 No Concubine Add-on","short":"This mod is a sub-mod of [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1843445119]Wu Kingdaissance[/url]. Please read and subscribe to Wu Kingdaissance before you subscribe to this one.\r","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"wu_kingdaissance_1.1.0_crazyai.pack","order":77,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1994310245/Wu_Kingdaissance_1.1.0_CrazyAI.pack","name":"Wu Kingdaissance - More Powerful AI V4.8.0","short":"This is an add-on mod of [url=https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=1843445119]Wu Kingdaissance[/url]. It is recommended that you use it along Wu, though it can work on its own as well.\r","category":"battle","owned":false},{"uuid":"wu_kingdaissance_1.1.0_equipment.pack","order":61,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1859462232/Wu_Kingdaissance_1.1.0_equipment.pack","name":"Wu Kingdaissance - Gifts From Heaven V5.4.0","short":"This mod is a sub-mod of [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1843445119]Wu Kingdaissance[/url], although it can work on its own as well.\r\n\r\nThis mod will give the player one of","category":"compilation","owned":false},{"uuid":"wu_kingdaissance_1.1.0_vn.pack","order":61,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1860304576/Wu_Kingdaissance_1.1.0_VN.pack","name":"Wu_Kingdaissance_V3.2.0_Vietnamese","short":"[b][i] Lưu ý Mod này là bản add-on cần bản Mod Gốc là \r\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1843445119] Wu kingdaissance v1.5.0 [/url] Để chạy được và cần mod việt hóa để thay ","category":"compilation","owned":false},{"uuid":"wu_kingdaissance_1.1.0_z.pack","order":75,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"","name":"Wu Kingdaissance - More Unique Unit Compatible Patch V4.8.0","short":"This is a compatible patch for more unique unit by Alex Zhao, and you would have to subscribe to [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1843445119]Wu Kingdaissance[/url] and [url=","category":"units","owned":false},{"uuid":"wu_kingdaissance_debut_1.1.0.pack","order":61,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1843500847/Wu_Kingdaissance_debut_1.1.0.pack","name":"Wu Kingdaissance - debut V5.4.0","short":"This mod is a sub-mod of [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1843445119]Wu Kingdaissance[/url]. Please read and subscribe to Wu Kingdaissance before you subscribe to this one.\r","category":"compilation","owned":false},{"uuid":"wu_kingdaissance_korean.pack","order":61,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1898021887/Wu_Kingdaissance_Korean.pack","name":"Wu_Kingdaissance 한글애드온","short":"This mod is Korean Addon.\r\n\r\n2020.11.25 이후로 패치로그도 추가합니다. '변경 내역' 탭에서 확인\r\n\r\n============================================================================\r\n번역된 애드온 목록 \r\nDebut\r\ntotal war three kingdoms ev","category":"ui","owned":false},{"uuid":"z_officer_hua_ling_.pack","order":51,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/3087034621/z_officer_hua_ling_.pack","name":"Hua Ling - Daughter of Hua Tuo","short":"[b]Compatible with Wu Anguo mod[/b]\r\n\r\nAdds Hua Ling, Hua Tuo's rumored/fictional Daughter.\r\nA healer type strategist general.\r\n\r\nHua Tuo was the famous Chinese Physician during the Three Kingdoms Era","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"zcaharpool.pack","order":10,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1791474375/Zcaharpool.pack","name":"Faster Character Pool Refresh 更快的人物池刷新","short":"Increased the speed of character pool refresh.","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"zhaoyunarrive.pack","order":61,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2033937349/ZhaoYunArrive.pack","name":"Zhao Yun join in turn 2","short":"Zhao Yun now will join you in turn 2 of year 190 or 194.\r\nIf you play year 182, than you have to wait till year 187 (he is not enough 18 years old this time).\r\n\r\nHe will join any faction that you lead","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"zhengjiang_test2.pack","order":40,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2100819454/zhengjiang_test2.pack","name":"More beautiful Zheng Jiang","short":"This mod change Zheng Jiang portrait ( ͡° ͜ʖ ͡°)\r\nThis is an old and rare mod. Not supported anymore but I really like it so I stepped in and keep it running\r\n[img]https://i.imgur.com/p7Fv1Z6.gif[/img","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"zhengjiangport.pack","order":52,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1821588856/ZhengJiangPort.pack","name":"Zheng Jiang | portrait retexture","short":"[b]❤Rate if you like, Favorite if you love.❤[/b]\r\n[h1]About this mod[/h1]\r\nThis mod changed Zheng Jiang portrait to match my [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1802799141][b]Z","category":"ui","owned":false},{"uuid":"zhengjiangretex.pack","order":50,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/conte