":"這個MOD修正Puzzle3D只有四肢的將軍，並讓模型完相容於MTU和Puzzle illustration.\r\n\r\n很抱歉無法在使用artmongky原本的MOD情況下修正問題\r\n\r\n我只能將它完全重新製作，如果artmongky不同意我可以將這個MOD刪除.\r\n\r\n推薦使用Drunken_PANDA的MTU/TUP Unique Models for Unique Characters來達到更","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"submod_zhengjiang.pack","order":25,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2246513756/submod_zhengjiang.pack","name":"More beautiful Zheng Jiang - submod for MTU","short":"[url=https://www.patreon.com/minatowantae] Support my patreon to support my work [/url]\r\n\r\nThis is a submod for my [b] More beautiful Zheng Jiang [/b] to make it more compatible with [b] Make Them Uni","category":"ui","owned":false},{"uuid":"wog_male.pack","order":53,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2968180405/wog_male.pack","name":"WOG - Male version","short":"這個Mod與WDG2功能完全相同，差別是使用CA立繪.\r\n\r\n與WDG2不相容，無法和WDG2一起使用.\r\n\r\n注意：此mod並不兼容TUP，因為這並不包含TUP模型，TUP必須與WDG2一起使用.\r\n\r\nMOD主要功能：\r\n\r\n1.修正男性自定義模型無法出現在戰場上的問題\r\n\r\n2.大量修正只有出現四肢的將軍\r\n\r\n3.可以任意變更裝備\r\n\r\n\r\nThis Mod has exactly the","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"lady_zou_194_200.pack","order":32,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2523919939/lady_zou_194_200.pack","name":"Zou Yuan joins in 194 or 200","short":"[h1]You need MTU[/h1]\r\n190 Version : https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2520836654\r\n\r\nNanman factions: ❌\r\nTUP :❌\r\n\r\n190 : ❌\r\n194 : ✅\r\n200 : ✅\r\n\r\nThis mod is useful and valid until ","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"lady_zou_joins.pack","order":23,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2520836654/lady_zou_joins.pack","name":"Zou Yuan joins player's faction in 190","short":"[h1]194 200 version : https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=252391993