汉”派系将领。\r\n\r\n---------------","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"drgoosladymiarrives.pack","order":30,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2424250477/DrGoosLadyMiArrives.pack","name":"Lady Mi Arrives 190 194 200","short":"Lady Mi Arrives 190 (works for 194 and 200)\r\n\r\nNOTE: Having more than 2 \"Arrives\" mods in 190 can push the game events out of date, I never intend people will use all of them but will choose a charact","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"tranhung.pack","order":22,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/common/Total War THREE KINGDOMS/data/TranHung.pack","name":"TranHung.pack","short":"","category":"","owned":true},{"uuid":"aw nanman ladys.pack","order":71,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/3339836889/AW Nanman Ladys.pack","name":"New20 Nanman Ladys","short":"Hello everyone~it's me AW\r\nThis MOD is compatible with MTU/TUP/WDG/NGC/Wu Kingdaissance/\r\n\r\nThis is a MOD of Nanman female generals. I personally like the design of Nanman very much. The characters ar","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"newladydong.pack","order":12,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/common/Total War THREE KINGDOMS/data/NewLadyDong.pack","name":"NewLadyDong.pack","short":"","category":"","owned":true},{"uuid":"thegathering_sandbox.pack","order":56,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1843327136/TheGathering_sandbox.pack","name":"The Gathering : Sandbox 2.3.55","short":"[img]https://i.imgur.com/MOLFf3c.png[/img]\r\n[olist]\r\n[*]2.3.55 - Update for TUP update.\r\n[*][h1]New UI[/h1]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]Why is my <The Gathering> mod series being attacked with 'negative ratings'?\r\n[*","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"clonalone.pack","order":12,"active":false,"ga