e to stop updating my m","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"kagamisfws.pack","order":5,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/3330103708/Kagamisfws.pack","name":"Female Water Strategist Graphics Change","short":"9/17/2024:\r\nHellow every,this is Kagami,there is my first workshop mod_(:з」∠)_\r\nPlease do not change author information, reorganize, or republish\r\nContains 10 different head graphics and 8 body graphi","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"![comver]newfactionsaddon&wu.pack","order":53,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/1918003067/![ComVer]NewFactionsAddon&Wu.pack","name":"更新24/5/21【黑熊的非官方DLC part 3】 -- 额外开局势力（名将复兴兼容版）","short":"[img]https://steamuserimages-a.akamaihd.net/ugc/1023947384901462665/C83C61421FBF1EE961B051A82BAB3D1F830071DD/[/img]\r\n\r\n\r\n这是我的额外势力开局与名将复兴的兼容版本。\r\n\r\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetail","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"@[tupcomver]newfactionsaddon.pack","order":55,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/2451398634/@[TUPComVer]NewFactionsAddon.pack","name":"更新24-5-22【黑熊的非官方DLC part 3】 -- 额外开局势力（TUP兼容版） 测试版","short":"重要：请检查TUP的页面以确认它所需的mod加载顺序。\r\n\r\n我的mod的三个part可以被随意放置，不需要在意顺序。TUP和MTU有顺序要求，请检查TUP的页面确认。\r\n\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT: Please check the TUP page to confirm its mod loading order \r\n\r\nThe 3 parts of my mod can be placed ","category":"overhaul","owned":false},{"uuid":"!!!zach_hurdur_ai_dumb_ca_stinky.pack","order":1,"active":false,"game":"warhammer3","packfile":"F:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/1142710/3594429287/!!!Zach_Hurdur_AI_Dumb_CA_STINKY.pack","name":"AI Camping Settlements Fix 9.x","short":"Howdy\r\n\r\n\r\nMade a fix and wanted to share it. Should fix most if not all instances of the AI doing nothing, camping their capitals and cities. \r\n\r\nIt overwrites/changes very specific ai behaviors for ","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"deepwar_ai.pack","order":2,"active":false,"game":"warhammer3","packfile":"F:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/1142710/2978779730/DeepWar_AI.pack","name":"DeepWar AI","short":"[h1]NEWS:[/h1]\r\n\r\nImproved the occupation logic for all factions. See changelog for details.\r\n\r\n10/30/26\r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\nPlease stop asking me about the AI breaking mid campaign. Vanilla bug from years back,","category":"campaign","owned":false},{"uuid":"ai_coordinated_assault.pack","order":3,"active":false,"game":"warhammer3","packfile":"F:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/1142710/3428755738/AI_Coordinated_Assault.pack","name":"AI Coordinated Assault","short":"[h1]General description[/h1]\r\n\r\n\r\nThis mod attempts to correct some inappropriate behaviors the AI displays in battle, such as sending its fastest and most powerful units directly into combat without ","category":"battle","owned":false},{"uuid":"!jdnvnanman.pack","order":9,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/3699509813/!JDnvnanman.pack","name":"Beautiful Nanman women  Portraits 南蛮女性大众脸美化","short":"应该不会和其他mod有冲突，排序尽量往上\r\nShould not conflict with other mods; load order as high as possible.","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"betterdiaochan.pack","order":28,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/3715881127/betterDiaoChan.pack","name":"better Diao Chan","short":"Diao Chan in base game is ugly than your mother, so i make it better.\r\n( Only change her portrait)","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"mydiaochan2.pack","order":27,"active":false,"game":"threekingdoms","packfile":"D:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/779340/3745911901/mydiaochan2.pack","name":"貂蝉立绘（Diao Chan’s portrait）","short":"用于替换貂蝉的立绘，排序放在其余貂蝉立绘之上即可生效\r\n分别做了低满意度、中等、高满意度三种表情\r\n\r\n[img]https://i.imgur.com/Ji7ibmK.p