,{"uuid":"@yuanboreskinsang.pack","order":15,"active":false,"game":"warhammer3","packfile":"F:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/1142710/3176514789/@YuanBoReskinSang.pack","name":"元伯模型美化  Yuan Bo model Reskin","short":"===========================================================================\r\n===========================================================================\r\n本mod是基于@deer24大佬的元伯美化模型的再加工，算是一个同人版本吧。\r\n\r\n修改点：","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"[c]lin_corruption_fay_(dress_short).pack","order":11,"active":false,"game":"warhammer3","packfile":"F:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/1142710/3672225225/[C]Lin_Corruption_Fay_(dress_short).pack","name":"网淘系列 - 湖神仙女美化腿版 (Fay Enchantress Reskin Thighs)","short":"在混沌破龍斩的湖神仙女美化的基础上，去除了裙子。\r\n\r\n喜欢的话请去支持原作者的mod：https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3571431962\r\n\r\n愿意请ta喝一杯快乐水的话，以下是原作者的：\r\nko-fi：https://ko-fi.com/likedota2009\r\n爱发电：https://afdian.com/a/","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"bastilean_young_shugengan.pack","order":14,"active":false,"game":"warhammer3","packfile":"F:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/1142710/2800286896/bastilean_young_shugengan.pack","name":"Young Shugengan Heroes (submod)","short":"This little submod replaces the Shugengan Heroes of Yin and Yang created by Singe with three young Shugengan head replacements from the handsome Cathayan peasant models.  This way you can easily disti","category":"units","owned":false},{"uuid":"beautiful neferata.pack","order":15,"active":false,"game":"warhammer3","packfile":"F:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/1142710/3809988722/Beautiful Neferata.pack","name":"Beautiful Neferata","short":"A full Neferata reskin! I went in a very non-canon direction with this. I wanted Neferata that actually looks like \"Queen of the Vampires\". All vampire-y and royal. So now she is wearing a beautiful d","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"dead_lumi_jade_hero_old.pack","order":18,"active":