brary/steamapps/workshop/content/1142710/3647419004/@endo_bretonnia.pack","name":"[Endo] Bretonnia","short":"This is a simple reskin mod that changes all Bretonnia units to be female with non-functional outfits. There is no full nudity in this mod. There are no changes to stats or gameplay. There are no depe","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"@endo_combined.pack","order":20,"active":false,"game":"warhammer3","packfile":"F:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/1142710/3683061804/@endo_combined.pack","name":"[Endo] Combined Faction Reskins","short":"[h1]Description[/h1][hr][/hr]\r\nUPDATE - Mod now includes most recent additions and ALL of the 'Slaaneshy' mod variants. I figured this is what people wanted from a pack like this. All hero/lord reskin","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"@endo_high_elf_loreful.pack","order":21,"active":false,"game":"warhammer3","packfile":"F:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/1142710/3696036773/@endo_high_elf_loreful.pack","name":"[Endo] High Elves - Loreful","short":"This is a simple reskin mod that changes adds mixed female units to all High Elf units. There are no changes to stats or gameplay. There are no dependencies for this mod and the models should not add ","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"@zeta0080_beautiful_vampires.pack","order":22,"active":false,"game":"warhammer3","packfile":"F:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/1142710/3267673457/@zeta0080_beautiful_vampires.pack","name":"Zeta0080 Beautiful Vampire Girls","short":"Description:\r\n2025/2/22 fix the portrait\r\n\r\nZeta0080's female vampire heroes and Isabella reskin. Please click the endorsement if you like it, so we can let more people to find this mod~ Thank you, an","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"full_plate_empire.pack","order":23,"active":false,"game":"warhammer3","packfile":"F:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/1142710/2822349159/Full_Plate_Empire.pack","name":"Full Plate Empire","short":"This mod makes state troops wear full plate armor (only visual).\r\n\r\nNote: Screenshots 1-4 are from Warhammer 2 and 5-7 from Warhammer 3\r\n\r\nJust as a quick heads up: Due to the Warhammer 3 lighting the","category":"graphical","owned":false},{"uuid":"stompies_emp_captain_reskin.pack","order":24,"active":false,"game":"warhammer3","packfile":"F:/SteamLibrary/steamapps/workshop/content/1142710/3000776836/stompies_emp_captain_reskin.pack","name":"Empire Captain Reskin (Update Not Needed)","short":"[h1]Description[/h1]\r\nThis is a graphical mod that reskins the two campaign variants of the Empire Captain.\r\n\r\nFeel free to use, edit or change any of my mods. You have my permission to do whatever yo","category":"graphical","owned":false}]